[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STD003
TITLE: Group membership for one computer and for three
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall start a group with n equal to 1 and expect that member to be the authority, then start a group with n equal to 3 and expect a member that has not joined to refuse a clearance. Acceptance is authority on the single member and refusal from the unjoined member.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The rural case and the redundant case are both part of the same requirement.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Low-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: Raft is assumed to deliver one ordered log and is not re-proved.
